1
00:00:00,201 --> 00:00:03,383
GlobalAstro Health — crew health decision support

2
00:00:03,383 --> 00:00:07,536
On board, the crew must spot a health drift alone: there is no doctor on board.

3
00:00:07,536 --> 00:00:11,254
Radiation is read as a share of the career limit, never as an absolute dose.

4
00:00:11,254 --> 00:00:15,369
On the ground, the surgeon sees the same values, at the same instant.

5
00:00:15,369 --> 00:00:19,429
He prepares an instruction. It leaves at the next communication window.

6
00:00:19,429 --> 00:00:24,063
On board, the crew receives it and acknowledges.

7
00:00:24,063 --> 00:00:27,329
The acknowledgement travels back: the loop is closed.

8
00:00:27,329 --> 00:00:28,022
globalastro.health
